<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - Producer, import, retail prices.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - Producer, import, retail prices.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA		     DATE</p>
<p> Producer prices   Jan	unch m/m, -0.3 pct y/y    Feb 24</p>
<p> Import prices     Jan	+0.8 m/m, +2.0 pct y/y    Feb 25-26</p>
<p> Prel W.Gmn CPI    Feb	+0.5 m/m, +1.9 pct y/y    Feb 27</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
